      "description": "Uses position_near_with_facing because this is a find/locate task. The player must navigate near the standalone oak log tree at relative position (6, 2, 2) and face it, confirming they have visually located it. Target is the mid-trunk of the oak log tree. Max distance of 8 blocks and facing tolerance of 60° ensures the player is looking at the tree.",
